{"id":"8f32f747a261016d","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict.md","title":"保守类之后的严格算术链","display":"prop-theory-hierarchy-strict — 保守类之后的严格算术链","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict","aliases":["91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict"],"display":"prop-theory-hierarchy-strict — 保守类之后的严格算术链","depends_on":["[[91-fact-theory-comparison]]","[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-CT]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-theory-hierarchy-strict — 保守类之后的严格算术链"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0dc2670ffdd2806\" href=\"?note=d0dc2670ffdd2806\" title=\"91-fact-theory-comparison\">91-fact-theory-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e1e503ea918b41a\" href=\"?note=4e1e503ea918b41a\" title=\"91-df-CT\">91-df-CT</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> 采用比较节点的标准版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为共同后果关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{UTB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{PA}\n\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{FS}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{UTB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{PA}\n\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{FS}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保守类等式来自实际保守定理，后半严格性来自对应分层真理与正归纳定义分析。PA 到 FS 的严格性还可由 FS 包含 CT、CT 证明 Con(PA) 而 PA 不能证明说明。\n这不是根据原子排列顺序给的排名。共同后果严格包含与逻辑背景是否经典或句法上能否自指均不同。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5、Corollary 8.33、Corollary 14.32、§15.3、第 18 章。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-fact-theory-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"d0dc2670ffdd2806","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-fact-theory-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-CT","status":"resolved","id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-CT]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{UTB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{PA}\n\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{FS}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.","display":true}],"bytes":1350,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-theory-hierarchy-strict]]"}],"outgoing":["d0dc2670ffdd2806","25c37fe51095276d","4e1e503ea918b41a"]}